<<^ code="&#x0002;">>

! Magic Decode

<<~ ahu #/definition>>

!! Definition

Decoding a magical inscription or interface layer into active, readable meaning — the core function of Read Magic.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/activation>>

!! Activation

Turns opaque marks into usable instruction: one inscription per activation at base P. Overcharge reads through veils or decodes more at once.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/interaction>>

!! Interaction

Depends on `domain/divination`; pairs with `function/archive` for the handshake that fetches an inscription's stored meaning. A `veil` or `spoof` raises its effective P or feeds it false meaning.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/filters>>

!! Filters

```text
[tag[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/function/magic-decode]]                          all decode modules
[tag[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/function/magic-decode]tag[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/domain/divination]]  decode-divinations
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/aftermath>>

!! Aftermath

* Confirm whether "decode" and "translate mundane script" stay one function or split.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/edges>>

!! Edges

